    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d747">

                <pb facs="1002" n="900" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg900"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Lithuania/111</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Lithuanian Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Balutis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-06-26">June 26, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The President directs me to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your note of June 23, 1933, in which you set forth the decision
                    of the Lithuanian Government to pay the Government of the United States the sum
                    of $10,000, as a payment on account and as an acknowledgment by the Lithuanian
                    Government of the debt due to the United States. The statement contained in your
                    notes of June 15 and June 23, 1933, as to the inability of your Government to
                    pay the entire amount due has been noted.</p>
                <p>In accordance with your request, the Government of the United <pb facs="1003"
                        n="901" xml:id="pg901"/> States will be glad to receive the representations
                    of the Government of Lithuania with regard to the entire debt question between
                    the two countries at a date to be agreed upon.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
